<import src="../../utils/banner.wxml"/>
<view class="page"><view class="row spread"><view class="title">收货地址</view><button class="primary small" bindtap="create">新增地址</button></view><template is="banner" data="{{error: error}}"/><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!items.length&&!editing&&!error}}">还没有收货地址，点击右上角新增地址。</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><view>{{item.name}} {{item.mobile}}</view><view class="sub">{{item.address}}</view><view class="actions"><button class="small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit">编辑</button><button class="small danger" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button></view></view><form wx:if="{{editing}}" class="card" bindsubmit="save"><input name="name" value="{{editing.name}}" placeholder="收件人"/><input name="mobile" value="{{editing.mobile}}" placeholder="手机号" type="number"/><input name="address" value="{{editing.address}}" placeholder="详细地址"/><view class="label">演练坐标（非地图选址）</view><input name="latitude" value="{{editing.latitude}}" type="digit"/><input name="longitude" value="{{editing.longitude}}" type="digit"/><view class="actions"><button class="primary" form-type="submit">保存地址</button><button bindtap="cancelEdit">取消</button></view><view class="foot">无需强制申请定位权限。预填坐标为配送范围内的虚构地址。</view></form></view>
